    "pantry_truth": {
      "type": "media-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "heading": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Oat Beverage That (Actually) Lives Up to the Label",
            "heading_size": "heading_l"
          }
        },
        "text": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We said oats, water, and a little salt. That is what is in the carton. No sunflower oil. No gums. No filler. Just certified organic oats, filtered water, and a pinch of sea salt - because a short ingredient list should not be a marketing claim. It should be the standard.</p><p><strong>Step inside our pantry:</strong></p><ul><li>Filtered Water</li><li>Canadian Organic Oats</li><li>Sea Salt</li><li>Sometimes Vanilla</li></ul><p>That is it.</p>"
          }
        },
        "button": {
          "type": "button",
          "settings": {
            "button_label": "Shop Varty",
            "button_link": "#flavours",
            "button_style": "solid"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "heading",
        "text",
        "button"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/varty-all-skus-ecommerce.jpg",
